  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How to write your name",
   "texto": [
    "Your name fits Japanese syllables. As there are no loose consonants (except n), a **u** or **o** is added: Carlos → **カルロス** (karurosu), David → **ダビド** (dabido).",
    "There is no **l**: the row r is used. Laura → **ラウラ** (raura).",
    "There is also no **v**: the b is used. And the Spanish **j** is written with the row h: Javier → **ハビエル** (habieru)."
   ]
